    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῠΐσκομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have diarrhoea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				2.19
			</span></i>:—prob. <i>flow</i> (metaph.) in <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				142
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>suffer from falling hair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Math.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὐτὴ στιγμὴ ῥυϊσκομένη ποιεῖ τὸ
				μέγεθος ἀλλ᾽ οὐ παρατιθεμένη πρὸς ἄλλην στιγμήν</span>
			<i>flowing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				722.30
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.5b
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			.</div>
